{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"891","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"疫情間塑膠製品激增 研究：2040年前海洋垃圾將增加兩倍","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E5%A1%91%E8%86%A0%E6%B5%B7%E5%BB%A2.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">研究顯示，若無法減少塑膠製品產量，在未來<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>年內，流入海洋的塑料廢物數量將會增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>倍。（法新社）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">020-07-24 10:51:01</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">〔即時新聞／綜合報導〕在武漢肺炎（新型冠狀病毒病，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">COVID-19</span>）流行期間，一次性塑膠製品的使用量明顯增加。根據非營利組織<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">23</span>日發表的新研究顯示，若各公司、政府無法大幅減少塑膠製品產量，在未來<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>年內，流入海洋的塑料廢物數量將會增加兩倍。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">《路透》報導，皮尤慈善信託基金會（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Pew Charitable Trusts</span>）和<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">SYSTEMIQ</span>合作，刊登在學術期刊《科學》的研究顯示，人類如果不採取任何行動，每年流入海洋的塑膠數量，將從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1100</span>萬噸增加到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2900</span>萬噸，直到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2040</span>年，海洋內累積的廢棄物總量將達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>億噸，相當於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>百萬隻藍鯨的重量。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">非營利組織國際固體廢棄物協會（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">International Solid Waste Association</span>，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">ISWA</span>）指出，疫情期間塑膠廢物增加，口罩、橡膠手套越來越常出現在海灘，全球的垃圾掩埋場堆滿廢物，外帶食物的餐盒容器和線上購物的包裝也持續激增。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">皮尤慈善信託基金會（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Pew Charitable Trusts</span>）資深經理、研究報告合著者劉溫妮（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Winnie Lau</span>，音譯）表示，塑料汙染會影響到所有人，不只是你、我或是單個國家的問題，而是每個人都會面臨到的問題。如果什麼都不做，情況將持續惡化。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">自<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1950</span>年以來，每年塑膠的產量都在迅速攀升，當時全球總產量為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">200</span>萬噸。<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2017</span>年的全球產量為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3.48</span>億噸，預計到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2040</span>年這項數據將再度翻倍。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">據報導，包括埃克森美孚（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">ExxonMobil</span>）、陶氏（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Dow</span>）、雪佛龍菲利普化學（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Chevron Phillips Chemical</span>）等大型塑膠製造商都表示，儘管塑料製品產量增加，仍將致力於解決塑膠汙染問題，資助清理廢物計畫。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">研究報告建議，政府應立法限制塑膠製品生產，並為可重複使用的替代物提供補助。可口可樂、百事可樂、雀巢等大品牌也承諾，會在產品包裝中使用更多回收原料。塑膠產業則反對政府針對一次性塑膠製品的禁令。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">研究則指出，到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2040</span>年，目前政府和企業的承諾只會使流入海洋的塑膠廢物減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7%</span>。研究顯示，為了將海洋廢物的流動減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">80%</span>，包裝應該要重新設計，以紙類或可堆肥的材料替代一次性塑膠，使可回收材料佔的比例增加一倍以上。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://news.ltn.com.tw/news/world/breakingnews/3238193</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-07-28","clk_count":"110"}},"__N_SSG":true}